<title>USA: Ugly Duckling files for stock offering.</title>
<headline>Ugly Duckling files for stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ugly Duckling Corp said on Wednesday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 3.25 million shares.</p>
<p>It said it granted to underwriters an option to buy up to another 487,500 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>Friedman, Billings, Ramsey &amp; Co Inc and Cruttenden Roth Inc agreed to underwrite the issue.</p>
<p>Ugly Duckling is a used-car sales and finance company.</p>
</text>
